<title>USA: Starrett Corp Q1 shr $0.03 vs $0.19.</title>
<headline>Starrett Corp Q1 shr $0.03 vs $0.19.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996(a)</p>
<p>			    $	 0.03	   $	 0.19</p>
<p> Net			     203,000		1,168,000</p>
<p> Revs			 37,951,000	     35,508,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    6,161,000		6,261,000</p>
<p>(a) 1996 reclassified to conform with 1997 numbers.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said results in the first quarter of 1997 reflect its Levitt Division experiencing a delay in delivery of homes in Puerto Rico due to an extended period of rain during the quarter. In addition, the company said its Grenadier management subsidiary, posted a decrease in operating income due to restructuring of a management agreement.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
